  "changelog": "Initial release of calibre-converter\n\n- Supports user requests to convert registered books or documents in Calibre to other formats.\n- Identifies books by book_id, calibre_id, or exact title.\n- Handles a wide range of formats (epub, mobi, azw3, pdf, docx, txt, html, etc.).\n- Relies on calibre-openclaw-server for all conversion operations; communicates via HTTP API only.\n- Informs the user of conversion status, including title, generated format, and output path.\n- Provides rules and recommendations for format selection and user interaction.",
